abstract: >-
  GSLIB Reborn is a 64-bit optimized recompilation of the classic GSLIB2
  geostatistical software library (Deutsch & Journel, 1998) for modern
  hardware. All 41 programs are compiled with Intel oneAPI ifx for 64-bit
  systems with heap-based memory allocation, OpenMP support, and increased
  parameter limits. The geostatistical algorithms are entirely the original
  work of C.V. Deutsch and A.G. Journel of Stanford University. This
  repository contains only minor build and performance optimizations.
  The original unmodified source code is available at gslib.com.
